| style="white-space:nowrap" | <nowiki>--=</nowiki> || Assign Roll Variable || Variable Name || Roll Equation (or text) to assign || Roll/Numeric variables are assigned with this command. The content will be processed as a dice roll, and various properties will be set along with the numeric results.
