| style="height: 40px; line-height:40px; text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:x-large; background-color:#020203; color:#e1e1e1; width: 70%" | Reentrant Sample Script without Notes<br> <span style="font-size: medium;"> Expand/Collapse with the link to the right</span>
