While the cards below should still work, there are, in many cases, better ways to do things using language features introduced after these were constructed. Please see the [https://github.com/kjaegers/ScriptCards/tree/main/ScriptCards_Examples Script Examples] section of the official ScriptCards GitHub repository for more current script examples.
